OL,3,GNEWSAVeterans find support through
OL,4,Agardening therapy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity in East Sussex is offering
OL,7,Fveterans a safe space to improve their
OL,8,Fmental health through gardening and
OL,9,Foutdoor activities.
OL,11,FThe Veterans' Growth programme uses
OL,12,Fhorticultural therapy to provide
OL,13,Fwellbeing support in addition to
OL,14,Fequipping ex-service personnel with new
OL,15,Fskills and confidence.
OL,17,FThe charity in Westfield said it had
OL,18,Fseen a rise in demand of its service.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
